{"parse": {"title": "红墙-06", "pageid": 65751, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-05\" title=\"红墙-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">红墙-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-07\" title=\"红墙-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">红墙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B0.B8.E4.B8.8D.E9.A4.8D.E8.B6.B3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"永不餍足\">永不餍足</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 永不餍足</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>虽然血和皮毛是早就被档案确认存在的残留物，但这实在是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……太多了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这到底是真的还是我眼花了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现实远远超出了雇佣兵的想象。尽管她反复闭上眼睛，又反复睁开，那景象仍然毫无变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>干燥没能蒸腾掉恶臭，浓烈的气味几乎立刻熏刺得她想要重新闭眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嘶，该死。是真的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>到处都是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>陈年的血迹……人血，锈痕……新鲜的血迹……不是人血——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……噢，剥皮的野兔尸体……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她艰难地分辨着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……呃——呕！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>天杀的，剥皮都不涂松油的吗？这味道也太恶心了，简直像发霉的宿醉呕吐物混合流浪汉的臭袜子榨汁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这么多的动物皮毛，昨天那个猎人带来的皮毛有这么多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我记得只是巨大的一捆动物皮，看上去是从大型动物身上弄下来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯又吞下一颗糖，试图更仔细地分辨，好与记忆中的画面相比较。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>兔皮、鹿皮、熊皮、浣熊皮……狗皮或者狼皮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>还有烂得只剩下硬质鳞片的鱼，白天看说不定还会反光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>种类还真是丰富。但是谁告诉他们剥皮行者偏爱尸体的皮呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>尸体的皮，对他们来说没有用啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……但这里面没有凯拉的血和头发。这倒是个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这很好，再好不过了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不，等等……这边这个更新鲜的血迹是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……羊血？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并未上前，也并未伸手触碰。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但手中陡生的粘滞感却那样真实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深肤色的女人摊开手，露出掌中粘腻的血渍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血液与胎中带出的羊水，浑浊而迟滞地勾连皮肤。它们顽抗着重力，以至于久久没能坠下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我还是认为这样没有用，凯拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>为什么呢？你刚才做得很好呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>接下来，我们只剩下最后的一个小家伙……我来还是你来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩笑弯了眼睛。她的瞳孔里有玩笑一样的期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……我已经……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>所以不了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她维持着摊开手的姿势。耸肩的时候一滴迟迟不坠的血终于落在草地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-309721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>而且我还是不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>你认为我不应该干预它的生死，我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>但如果不把它接生出来，让它能够像其他兄弟姐妹一样站立……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>它就活不下来。而为了保护它到最后一秒，它的母亲也可能被剥皮行者盯上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>因为还没有死去，却前所未有虚弱的母羊……是它们最喜爱的、最具有欺骗性的皮囊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-309719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-309719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-309719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……“剥皮行者”？那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>天哪，你竟然不知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>真抱歉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩说着抱歉，却“咯咯”地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>你居然没有听过这个睡前故事，看来，我得给你补上才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>剥皮行者就是……让我想想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>这么说吧。你会不会觉得，有时候，你熟悉的朋友被另外的人取代了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我的眼睛可以看穿一切虚饰与伪装，你知道的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年长的女人最终还是站了起来，开始把血水往裤子上抹。这件牛仔裤已经穿过太久，久到即便用来擦手也不会心疼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>呵呵～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>但是剥皮行者的伪装，或许即使是你也无法辨认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>它们看上去与人没有什么两样，却会夺走动物的皮毛，变成家畜，变成宠物，在人们放松警惕的空隙接近，啖食血肉，或是把他们转化成同类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>他们是这片蛮荒里最恐怖的猎食者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>先不说这是个故事……就算它是真的，也没有怪物能躲得过我的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>有我看着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>是呀，是呀，百眼的巨人，我最可靠的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-627001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">凯拉：</div><div>现在，先让我们来帮帮这个小家伙吧，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……是的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我会认出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苦目糖的功效逐渐褪去，视野重归模糊，只剩一片渺然的月色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_at_aergusi\"><img alt=\"2_1_at_aergusi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png/600px-Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png/900px-Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_at_aergusi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯像咀嚼糖的余味一样咀嚼那些听过的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“为了躲避剥皮行者，人们在最炎热的收获季于凶案地点放下皮毛与血肉，伪装成完美的猎物，期待一场交换，却不知道这样做只是徒劳。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“被人们杀死的牲畜不会重新回到农场，捕食者也不会停下脚步。夜晚在山坡上用后脚直立的血红公牛，嘴里正衔着那些被献出的皮毛，像一面面招摇的旗帜。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“而后，村庄被血洗，人与牲畜的尸体混作一处……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“只有在这种时刻，平等才真正降临。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>一场非同时、漫长的屠杀……“人与牲畜的尸体混作一处”，就像现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯握紧枪，转身向着来时的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>失踪者还在增加，他们的祈祷没有任何用处……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>而我能找到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不管是雇佣兵还是剥皮行者——我都能找出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那我就得把这个杂种找出来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "红墙-06"}}